  "$id": "stoner:interactive-lab:report:v2",
  "description": "Every JSON file is independently limited to 1 MiB. Human acceptance is never generated by machine validation. Version 2 native/wrapper evidence adds capability-constrained profile requests; other envelope versions remain unchanged.",
